  <item>
    <title>人生若只如初见，我一定第一时间避开你</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a3a2a47349f7a557c4d7f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a3a2a47349f7a557c4d7f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈咯大家好呀～欢迎来到波动心玄！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们来聊聊面相～如何通过第一印象判断他人的内在？在996强度的工作环境中，我们与同事甚至比家人相处时间更多。通过详细解析穿搭、面相等细节，学会趋利避害。是不是可以从一个人的衣着风格、面相特征解读出他未来与你的关系？在保持正常社交距离的前提下，我们还能借助这些小技法，帮助自己避免不必要的麻烦。这到底是玄学还是真有依据？一起探索这些有趣的小BUFF吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每日穿搭：关注波动心玄公众号喔～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqH5jCXIp25annXoS-y6039vWPWZ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>分段概要</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a></span></a><span>:始于颜值，陷于才华，忠于人品：我的交友之道</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">00:04:00</a></span></a><span>:职场精英希宝：穿搭、交流和留下深刻印象的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">00:07:14</a></span></a><span>:如何突破第一印象的主观性？探讨真正认识他人的方法。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3058778025&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1000668524#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">00:10:51</a></span></a><span>:如何通过面相和穿搭看人？趋吉避凶的智慧所在！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/v